<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Stanprop lifts yr distributable income.</title>
<headline>Stanprop lifts yr distributable income.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Distributable income (cts)	  23.60     vs    21.25</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		12.20 making 23.60     vs    21.25</p>
<p>    Distributable income		  68.95     vs    60.85</p>
<p>    Rental income			   59.15     vs    52.84</p>
<p>    Interest received		     12.87     vs    10.87</p>
<p>    Service and sundry costs	     3.08     vs    2.86</p>
<p>Div payable February 28</p>
<p>on register February 14</p>
<p>Full name: Standard Bank Property Fund</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
